"[EHL-PCG-010] Equipment %(code)s is overdue for statutory inspection (was "
"%(date)s); it cannot be assigned to a convoy until the inspection date is "
"updated."
msgstr ""
"[EHL-PCG-010] 设备 %(code)s 已逾期未进行法定检验（原定 %(date)s）；在更新检验日期之前，无法将其分配给车队。"

